WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:07.883
Let's add one fifth and two fifths.

2
00:00:10.867 --> 00:00:12.167
Here is one fifth.

3
00:00:14.167 --> 00:00:15.607
Add two more fifths.

4
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:18.086
Now 3 parts are coloured.

5
00:00:19.067 --> 00:00:21.110
The bar still has 5 parts.

6
00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.654
Add the tops. The bottom stays the same.

7
00:00:27.633 --> 00:00:31.116
Never add the bottoms! The parts do not change size.

8
00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:34.818
What if the bottoms are different?

9
00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.611
The parts are different sizes.

10
00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:41.993
We can't add them yet.

11
00:00:43.967 --> 00:00:46.986
Find the LCM of 3 and 4. It is 12.

12
00:00:49.967 --> 00:00:51.917
Cut both bars into 12 parts.

13
00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:54.665
One third is 4 twelfths.

14
00:00:55.633 --> 00:00:57.491
One quarter is 3 twelfths.

15
00:01:01.467 --> 00:01:04.904
Now the parts match. 4 + 3 equals 7.

16
00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:12.361
Make the bottoms match, then add the tops.
